<title>CANADA: Canada dlr opens slightly firmer in light trading.</title>
<headline>Canada dlr opens slightly firmer in light trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3910/1.3950	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3920</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3855   SUPPORT 1.3400	HI 1.3932   LO  1.3919</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3921/26    HI 1.3932     EUROPE OPEN     1.3825</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3930/35    LO 1.3919     HI 1.3928   LO  1.3918</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar opened slightly firmer at C$1.3921 (US$0.7183) in light trading on Thursday after a quiet night on overseas markets, traders said. * They said the sudden decline of the dollar in trading yesterday had little to do with comments by Bank of Canada Governor Gordon Thiessen who indicated the Bank may not match U.S. interest rate hikes.</p>
